<title>UK: UBS sets call warrants on two Swiss stocks.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on two Swiss stocks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland said it has issued American-style call warrants on two Swiss stocks.</p>
<p>There are 10 million warrants on registered shares of Zurich Insurance Co and 20 million on registered shares of Credit Suisse Group.</p>
<p> PAYMENT DATE    14.MAR.97		 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX					     * * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT    STRIKE   ISSUE     PREMIUM   GEARING	MATURITY</p>
<p>ZURICH INSURANCE (SPOT REF 451 CHF)</p>
<p>		475 CHF  3.09 CHF  12.1 PCT  14.6 TIMES   20.MAR.98</p>
<p>CREDIT SUISSE GROUP (SPOT REF 158.75 CHF)</p>
<p>		170 CHF  1.95 CHF  13.5 PCT  16.2 TIMES   17.APR.98</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
